00:00:24.474 --> 00:00:32.474
or a word, and trailing white space is a space after the word or after a letter.

00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:39.180
Okay, so how can I find a leading white space? So basically, I could use a function grep().

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:51.313
