00:01:01.514 --> 00:01:09.514
which means that that particular pattern was found in the first and the third element of that vector.

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:20.110
If I would like to find a trailing white space, I'm first defining that character class with a space and a tab,

00:01:20.247 --> 00:01:27.247
