and then larger than symbol. And indeed, the output is 4, I found

00:03:24.388 --> 00:03:27.388
these two tags and the text between them. So the question marks here are used to make the asterisk quantifiers lazy

00:03:27.946 --> 00:03:36.946
or not greedy, such that they stop as soon as possible. So, dot asterisks and a question mark, matches the shortest tag,

00:03:37.188 --> 00:03:43.188
meaning this tag, yeah? So, smaller than B, larger than. Without that

